# Source: https://github.com/samtools/htslib/issues/1085
# Symptom: BED5 where name column contains a float value (e.g. 100.0); this is spec-legal as name is any string;
# a float in col4 of a 5-6 column BED avoids htslib's FASTA-IDX misdetection triggered by integers
chr21	1000	20000	500.0	0
chr21	25000	40000	750.5	0
chr22	1000	5000	250.1	0
